OL,3,GNEWSAGavin and Stacey stars to feature
OL,4,Ain festive Julia Donaldson TV
OL,5,Aadaptation
OL,6,
OL,7,FA new animated adaptation of a popular
OL,8,Fpicture book to be aired over the
OL,9,FChristmas period will be voiced by
OL,10,FWelsh actor Rob Brydon and some of his
OL,11,FGavin and Stacey co-stars.
OL,13,FThe Baddies, by children's author Dame
OL,14,FJulia Donaldson and illustrator Axel
OL,15,FScheffler, tells the story of a troll,
OL,16,Fa ghost and a witch.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
