OL,3,GNEWSAGavin and Stacey stars to feature
OL,4,Ain festive Julia Donaldson TV
OL,5,Aadaptation
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrydon, as Ghost, will be joined by
OL,8,FSheridan Smith and Alison Steadman, who
OL,9,Falso starred alongside him in the
OL,10,Fpopular sitcom, as well as Hammed
OL,11,FAnimashaun as Troll, Robyn Cara as
OL,12,FGirl, and Francesca Mills as the
OL,13,Fnarrator.
OL,15,FPrevious adaptations of Dame
OL,16,FDonaldson's books include The Gruffalo,
OL,17,FZog and The Scarecrows' Wedding, which
OL,18,Falso featured Brydon as scarecrow
OL,19,FReginald Rake.
